  "guide.modular_dreams.armor.1": "Modular armor is assembled from plates and a lining. Plates define defense, toughness and durability; the lining adds utility and a little extra enchantability.",
  "guide.modular_dreams.armor.2": "Armor made of a material looks and protects like its vanilla counterpart - iron plates look like iron armor.",
  "guide.modular_dreams.armor.material.defense": "Defense (B/L/C/H):",
  "guide.modular_dreams.armor.material.durability": "Durability:",
  "guide.modular_dreams.armor.material.enchantability": "Enchantability:",
  "guide.modular_dreams.armor.material.lining_durability": "Durability bonus:",
  "guide.modular_dreams.armor.material.lining_enchantability": "Enchantability bonus:",
  "guide.modular_dreams.armor.material.toughness": "Toughness:",
  "guide.modular_dreams.armor.plates.1": "Defense values are listed as boots/legs/chest/helmet.",
  "guide.modular_dreams.armor.plates.title": "Plates & Linings",
  "guide.modular_dreams.armor.stats.defense": "Defense: armor points from the plate material.",
  "guide.modular_dreams.armor.stats.durability": "Durability: plate multiplier x slot factor x (1 + lining bonus).",
  "guide.modular_dreams.armor.stats.enchantability": "Enchantability: plate value + lining bonus.",
  "guide.modular_dreams.armor.stats.knockback": "Knockback resistance: from netherite and armadillo plates.",
  "guide.modular_dreams.armor.stats.note": "Armor accepts trims, enchantments and all armor modifiers.",
  "guide.modular_dreams.armor.stats.title": "Armor Stats",
  "guide.modular_dreams.armor.stats.toughness": "Toughness: reduces heavy hits (diamond, netherite).",
  "guide.modular_dreams.armor.title": "Modular Armor",
  "guide.modular_dreams.intro.1": "Why throw away a worn-out tool when you can repair and upgrade it? Modular Dreams lets you build vanilla tools, weapons and armor from parts made of vanilla materials.",
  "guide.modular_dreams.intro.2": "Keep this book handy - it documents every material, part and modifier.",
  "guide.modular_dreams.intro.3": "- The Modular Dreams Team",
  "guide.modular_dreams.intro.armor_parts.1": "Armor uses two part kinds: sturdy plates define your protection, and the lining adds comfort and utility.",
  "guide.modular_dreams.intro.armor_parts.title": "Armor Parts",
  "guide.modular_dreams.intro.parts.1": "Every tool is assembled from these parts, each crafted from a vanilla material:",
  "guide.modular_dreams.intro.parts.title": "Tool Parts",
  "guide.modular_dreams.intro.philosophy.1": "Modular tools cost a little more material than their vanilla counterparts, but they are an investment: repair them forever, re-purpose them with new parts and enhance them with modifiers.",
  "guide.modular_dreams.intro.philosophy.2": "Stats are inherited from the materials of each part. A pickaxe with an iron head mines like iron; a spruce handle adds durability. Mix and match to shape the tool you need.",
  "guide.modular_dreams.intro.philosophy.title": "Philosophy",
  "guide.modular_dreams.material.binding": "Binding durability:",
  "guide.modular_dreams.material.damage": "Attack damage:",
  "guide.modular_dreams.material.durability": "Durability:",
  "guide.modular_dreams.material.enchantability": "Enchantability:",
  "guide.modular_dreams.material.handle": "Handle durability:",
  "guide.modular_dreams.material.speed": "Mining speed:",
  "guide.modular_dreams.material.tier": "Tier:",
  "guide.modular_dreams.materials.intro.1": "Every material has a role: woods are cheap handles, stones are honest heads, metals are dependable, gems are exceptional.",
  "guide.modular_dreams.materials.intro.2": "The following pages list every tool material. Durability and speed apply to heads; handle/binding show their durability bonus.",
  "guide.modular_dreams.materials.title": "Tool Materials",
  "guide.modular_dreams.modifiers.1": "Modifiers upgrade assembled equipment. Place the item and the cost in a crafting grid - no station needed. Levels stack up to the maximum.",
  "guide.modular_dreams.modifiers.2": "Tool modifiers only fit tools, armor modifiers only fit armor, and universal ones fit both. The next pages list every modifier and its cost.",
  "guide.modular_dreams.modifiers.list.title": "Modifier List",
  "guide.modular_dreams.modifiers.title": "Modifiers",
  "guide.modular_dreams.repair.1": "Combine a damaged item with ONE repair material in a crafting grid to restore 10% of its max durability. Repeat as often as you like - the item is never consumed.",
  "guide.modular_dreams.repair.2": "What repairs what? Tools: their head material's crafting item (iron ingots repair iron heads). Armor: the plate material's repair items. Wood handles also accept sticks.",
  "guide.modular_dreams.repair.3": "Anvils and Mending work too - modular items know their repair items. Enchanted gear keeps every enchantment and modifier while being repaired.",
  "guide.modular_dreams.repair.4": "Note: upgrade modifiers cost 2 or more of their item, so a single item always repairs instead of upgrading.",
  "guide.modular_dreams.repair.advanced.title": "Repairing, continued",
  "guide.modular_dreams.repair.title": "Repairing",
  "guide.modular_dreams.started.1.1": "1. Craft part items from a material (e.g. 3 iron ingots in a row make an Iron Pickaxe Head).",
  "guide.modular_dreams.started.1.2": "2. Combine the parts in a crafting table in any arrangement to assemble your tool.",
  "guide.modular_dreams.started.1.title": "Getting Started",
  "guide.modular_dreams.started.2.1": "Pickaxe/Axe/Spear: head + binding + handle. Sword: blade + guard + handle. Shovel/Hoe/Mace: head + handle.",
  "guide.modular_dreams.started.2.2": "Armor: Helmet 3 plates + lining, Chestplate 4 plates + lining, Leggings 3 plates + lining, Boots 2 plates + lining.",
  "guide.modular_dreams.started.2.3": "Turtle scute plates only fit the helmet - it is a shell, not sheet metal!",
  "guide.modular_dreams.started.2.title": "Assembly Recipes",
  "guide.modular_dreams.started.3.1": "The HEAD defines mining speed, mining tier and adds the most attack damage. The HANDLE multiplies durability and can add attack speed. The BINDING adds even more durability and can grant traits.",
  "guide.modular_dreams.started.3.2": "Example: an iron head on a spruce handle with an amethyst binding is fast, durable and resonant.",
  "guide.modular_dreams.started.3.3": "Lining choice matters too: slime cushions falls, phantom membrane lightens them, wool quiets your steps.",
  "guide.modular_dreams.started.3.title": "The Part Choice",
  "guide.modular_dreams.tips.1": "- A gold binding gilds any tool with +3 enchantability.\n- An amethyst binding resonates: +10% mining speed.\n- Bone handles swing faster; obsidian heads shrug off damage.\n- Netherite parts are fireproof - and so is your gear.",
  "guide.modular_dreams.tips.2": "- Hasty + resonant + diamond head = instant mining.\n- Turtle shell helmets swim; slime linings land softly.\n- You can re-craft improved versions any time - parts are never wasted, and repairs keep gear alive forever.",
  "guide.modular_dreams.tips.title": "Tips & Tricks",
  "guide.modular_dreams.title": "Materials & You",
  "guide.modular_dreams.tools.1": "Modular versions exist of every classic tool plus the mace and the spear. The mace keeps its full smash attack; the spear keeps its charged dash - both scale with your head material.",
  "guide.modular_dreams.tools.2": "Modular tools can do anything their vanilla counterparts can: enchant them, trim armor, repair with mending...",
  "guide.modular_dreams.tools.mace.1": "The modular mace keeps the vanilla smash attack: fall further, hit harder. Its density comes from the head material.",
  "guide.modular_dreams.tools.mace.2": "An obsidian or netherite head makes a truly brutal mace.",
  "guide.modular_dreams.tools.mace.title": "The Mace",
  "guide.modular_dreams.tools.spear.1": "The modular spear keeps the vanilla charge: sprint or ride to strike with reach and momentum. Its damage grows with the head material.",
  "guide.modular_dreams.tools.spear.2": "Pair it with the Bouncy modifier for devastating cavalry charges.",
  "guide.modular_dreams.tools.spear.title": "The Spear",
  "guide.modular_dreams.tools.stats.attackspeed": "Attack speed: swings per second x4 (handle can improve it).",
  "guide.modular_dreams.tools.stats.damage": "Attack damage: tool base + head material.",
  "guide.modular_dreams.tools.stats.durability": "Durability: how much use before repair (head + handle + binding bonuses).",
  "guide.modular_dreams.tools.stats.enchantability": "Enchantability: better books, better enchants.",
  "guide.modular_dreams.tools.stats.note": "Every stat can be tuned with modifiers and traits - build the tool you want.",
  "guide.modular_dreams.tools.stats.speed": "Mining speed: blocks per second multiplier (head material).",
  "guide.modular_dreams.tools.stats.tier": "Mining tier: which blocks drop loot (head material).",
  "guide.modular_dreams.tools.stats.title": "Tool Stats",
